    <item>
      <title>Lineup 2.2.0</title>
      <link>https://lineup.caiano.com/</link>
      <sparkle:version>23</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>https://lineup.caiano.com/release-notes/2.2.0</sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>Lineup 2.2.0</h2>
        <p>Adds Keep Awake, an optional tool for preventing idle sleep during a timed session.
        Enable it in Settings, then start a 15-minute, 30-minute, 1-hour or 2-hour session
        from Settings or the menu bar. See the remaining time and stop whenever you want.</p>
        <p>Keeping the display on is a separate option, off by default. Changing that option
        preserves the remaining time. Sessions end on expiry, disable, quit or explicit sleep,
        and never resume automatically after wake or relaunch.</p>
        <p>While Zones is running, apps return to their last successfully used zone when they
        relaunch. Placements made with Lineup shortcuts and Shift-drag are remembered; existing
        windows are left alone when Zones starts.</p>
      ]]></description>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:31:12 +0000</pubDate>
